  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Sanctions, asset freezes and risk-off reactions tied to the conflict drain dollar- and euro-denominated liquidity and banking correspondent lines, directly reducing the capacity and willingness for international capital flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">state_crypto_cybercrime</data>
