  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sanctions, capital flight and risk-off linked to the Russia–Ukraine war tighten global liquidity and insurance/financing for shipping, causing higher insurer refusals/fees and vessel reroutings that raise the risk of Persian Gulf supply disruptions during US–Iran tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
