  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in geopolitical tension tied to US–China tech rivalry prompts the US to harden military and diplomatic postures (e.g., increased regional deployments, tougher sanctions enforcement) to deter adversary alignments, provoking reciprocal Iranian responses and raising US–Iran tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
