  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Deterioration in energy infrastructure security (weaker defenses/patching) directly raises the exploitable attack surface, leading to a higher incidence of successful cyberattacks against energy and adjacent systems.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
