  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Improvements in energy infrastructure security (physical and cyber) directly reduce the probability of successful attacks or failures on oil production and transport, thereby lowering the risk of supply disruptions in the US–Iran theater; conversely, degradation raises that risk.</data>
