  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher oil prices rapidly induce demand destruction and bring high-cost producers and curtailed shale output back online, reducing the supply–demand gap within months.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_market_turbulence</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
