  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising investor risk appetite channels more private capital into infrastructure upgrades and cybersecurity projects for energy firms, strengthening physical and cyber resilience but typically over a multi-quarter project cycle.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">state_crypto_cybercrime</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
