  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge of cross-border capital into commodity funds and physical commodity markets increases speculative and inventory demand for crude, mechanically pushing benchmark oil prices higher over trading horizons.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
