  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in net cross‑border capital inflows (including crypto‑derived flows) into safe‑haven sovereign debt compresses yields and market-implied forward rates, lowering expectations for future central‑bank policy rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">state_crypto_cybercrime</data>
