  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Large and rapid reversals in cross-border capital flows produce sharp adjustments in FX, bond and equity positions and force portfolio rebalancing, directly increasing price swings and financial market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">state_crypto_cybercrime</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
