  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in successful cyber intrusions directly degrades operational control systems and forces shutdowns or degraded monitoring at oil, gas and grid facilities, reducing the operational integrity and resilience of energy infrastructure within weeks to months.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">state_crypto_cybercrime</data>
