  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in high-profile cyberattacks that are attributed (publicly or by intelligence) to Chinese state actors or proxies provokes diplomatic protests, sanctions, and military signaling from the US, elevating bilateral geopolitical tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
